 "lines": [
  "The U.S. Army once bought camels for Texas.",
  "In 1855, Congress gave War Secretary Jefferson Davis $30,000 to try it.",
  "A Navy ship sailed to Egypt and Turkey to buy them.",
  "33 camels sailed, and 34 landed, because calves were born on board.",
  "In 1857, they hauled loads from Texas to California.",
  "Each could carry twice what a mule could.",
  "Then the Civil War ended the experiment.",
  "Some camels were set loose and roamed the desert for decades, because..."
